0001: deterministic single-threaded schedule for the OKVIS2-X reference build (port of okvis_port patch 0001).
 - ThreadedSlam::processFrame: join the realtime optimisation thread, then run the background (loop-closure /
   pose-graph) optimisation to completion inside the same frame, so import timing no longer depends on wall-clock races.
 - ThreadedSlam: non-blocking publication push replaced by a blocking one (the app already uses setBlocking(true)).
 - Frontend::matchToMap{,Uninitialised}: the num_matching_threads keypoint segments are executed one after another on
   the calling thread (identical partition => identical results). The stereo-init matcher workers (Frontend.cpp ~2015)
   write disjoint matchInfos[k0] slots and are left alone, as in okvis_port.
 - opengv SampleConsensusProblem / MultiSampleConsensusProblem: RANSAC RNG always seeded 12345.

